From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Raine Makelainen <raine.makelainen@jolla.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jan 2020 11:09:02 +0000
Subject: Use fileservice for Sailfish handler checks. Fixes JB#51235

[sailfishos][gecko] Use lipstick fileservice for custom scheme URI and MIME
handler support checks. JB#47892

This allows Gecko's handler availability checks to include AppSupport handlers
reported by lipstick, while keeping actual launch handling on the existing Qt
open URL path.

Signed-off-by: Raine Makelainen <raine.makelainen@jolla.com>
